        (`reg 39(1) the amount to be deducted, before the limit of subsection (2)` (`reg 39(3) the earnings of the claimant during the waiting period` items) `paragraph 19(3)(a) or 152.18(3)(a) of the Act applies in respect of those earnings` `the amount required by that paragraph to be deducted`)
