-- reg 39.01 [Repealed, SOR/2021-3, s. 2] (line 700).

§ `Regulation 39.1 -- waiving of the waiting period for apprentices`

-- The waiting period "shall be waived" if (a) the claimant is attending a required course of an apprenticeship
-- program to which they were referred under s 25(1)(a) of the Act, (b) the claimant has ceased working for that
-- reason, and (c) the claimant has, after the coming into force of this section, served a waiting period for a
-- course that is a required part of the same apprenticeship program. "After the coming into force" is read
-- as on a day after the day on which the section came into force (fork F10); that day is an input because the
-- text does not state it.
-- src:703 | 39.1 The waiting period shall be waived if the following conditions are met:
-- src:704 | (a) the claimant is attending a course that is a required part of an apprenticeship program and to which they are referred pursuant to paragraph 25(1)(a) of the Act;
-- src:705 | (b) the claimant has ceased working for the reason described in paragraph (a); and
-- src:706 | (c) the claimant has, after the coming into force of this section, served a waiting period in respect of a course that is a required part of the same apprenticeship program.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 39.1 (src:703-706)
GIVEN `the claimant is attending a course that is a required part of an apprenticeship program and to which they are referred pursuant to paragraph 25(1)(a) of the Act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the claimant has ceased working for the reason described in paragraph (a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the claimant has served a waiting period in respect of a course that is a required part of the same apprenticeship program` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day on which that waiting period was served` IS A DATE
      `the day on which regulation 39.1 came into force` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 39.1 the waiting period is waived` IF
        `the claimant is attending a course that is a required part of an apprenticeship program and to which they are referred pursuant to paragraph 25(1)(a) of the Act`
    AND `the claimant has ceased working for the reason described in paragraph (a)`
    AND `the claimant has served a waiting period in respect of a course that is a required part of the same apprenticeship program`
    AND `the day on which that waiting period was served` GREATER THAN `the day on which regulation 39.1 came into force`
